&lt;p&gt;We hope you have enjoyed this walk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="parking"&gt;Parking
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Most people would approach this from the main A386 Plymouth to Yelverton road, turning off at the sign for Clearbrook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The posted coordinates are for a free gravel car park of a good size. There are no facilities at the start point, but the welcoming &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.skylarkinn.co.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Skylark Inn&lt;/a&gt; is very close by at Clearbrook.
If the posted car park is full, there is another a hundred meters or so down the road to the East, and a third a half mile along there which is close to our walking route.&lt;/p&gt;
